<title>UK: Scott Fetzer Financial sets $100 mln 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Scott Fetzer Financial sets $100 mln 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCOTT FETZER FINANCIAL GROUP INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BERKSHIRE HATHAWAY INC</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    31.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S03.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY    * AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	* AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
